-Install Aspire CLI **13.6.4** to match the catalog embedded in module tool **4.43.6**. The local tool manifest pins that module version; `dotnet tool restore` restores that exact version. The tool owns run-scoped infrastructure, readiness and diagnostics; its catalog requires Dapr CLI 1.18.2 and runtime 1.18.7. Set `HEXALITH_DAPR_HOME` to a prepared absolute isolated Dapr home using the [pinned Platform prerequisites](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Platform/blob/8ea8fe092f8abb5c932a61830aae16051d442463/README.md#run-and-debug-a-technical-module); an unset or unprepared home is refused.
